Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.73,0:00:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.27,0:01:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no business being here, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.55,0:01:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him speak. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.69,0:01:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We were all doing just fine without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.43,0:01:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.23,0:01:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're barely able to stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.83,0:01:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.25,0:01:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if you can just stay on your\Nfeet for a few moments longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll witness my triumph over the\NPharaoh and the demise of my weak side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.09,0:01:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's in bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's in no condition to\Nbe wandering around out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.11,0:01:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! No, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is something Odeon must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.41,0:01:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be the only way to save Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.59,0:01:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Release my master now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.57,0:01:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your master is almost gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you've come too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.35,0:02:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I've taken his body, and the Shadow\NRealm is about to take his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.47,0:02:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Merrick you once knew\Nwill soon be extinct, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.11,0:02:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll no longer be able to hold me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.67,0:02:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.17,0:02:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I've returned to ensure that\Nyour gentle spirit prevails.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.41,0:02:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.03,0:02:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.45,0:02:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Merrick, fight the\Nevil within. We've conquered.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,your wicked side before And\Nwe can do it again Silence
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.87,0:02:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I'm fine, Ishizu
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.27,0:02:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Master
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.95,0:02:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the power to stop your dark
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Darkseid, remember you're\Nthe one that created him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:02:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.09,0:03:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.87,0:03:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.07,0:03:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see what I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.59,0:03:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick is freaking out up there. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.47,0:03:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.19,0:03:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm regaining control of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.51,0:03:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight his evil with all\Nyour might, Master Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.69,0:03:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let your Tomb Keeper's\Nheritage give you strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.85,0:03:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come too far to lose my grip now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.23,0:03:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the true Merrick, and I will\Nnot be overpowered by my weak side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.69,0:03:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can hear me, Pharaoh,\Nattack now. No, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.29,0:03:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Pharaoh, I can't\Nhold on much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.43,0:03:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your help to banish\Nmy dark half forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for everything\NI've done to you and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.41,0:03:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends as a tomb\Nkeeper, I was raised to serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.79,0:03:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you but I always resented\Nthis task this resentment
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.51,0:03:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,turned to hatred and my dark half was born
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:04:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,what I did was wrong but I'm ready to take
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.89,0:04:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,responsibility for my actions\Nand correct the wrongs
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.77,0:04:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I've committed. Well said,\Nmaster. I've waited so
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.97,0:04:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,long to hear those words\Nplease Pharaoh Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.49,0:04:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only hope for my survival!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.39,0:04:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.89,0:04:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You must attack me to save\Nmankind! Please! But hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.51,0:04:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hold him back much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.61,0:04:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't attack him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.87,0:04:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just too risky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.73,0:04:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The force of our attack could send\Nhim straight to the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.17,0:04:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, we have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.41,0:04:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We must trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Please attack me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.47,0:04:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.75,0:04:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my Ragnarok card! Now! Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.71,0:04:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,since my Dark Magician and my Dark\NMagician Girl are both on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.05,0:04:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,the unstoppable magic of\NRagnarok can be released!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.49,0:05:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I must remove every monster\Nin my hand, deck, and graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're making a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.25,0:05:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ragnarok is already infused with the\Npower of every one of my monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.57,0:05:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, dark magicians, with the help\Nof my entire army of monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,unleash your incredible force!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.41,0:05:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.11,0:05:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Yugi's monsters on parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.03,0:05:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.47,0:05:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your Egyptian\Ngod card are through.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.19,0:05:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.23,0:05:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Call these creatures off right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can destroy my winged dragon of Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Release me! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.61,0:06:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pointless for you\Nto resist my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They have you trapped in\Ntheir unbreakable grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reign of terror is finally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.01,0:06:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come for\Nme to fulfill my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and rid the world of your\Nevil once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.19,0:06:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,May the magic of Ragnarok\Nrid the field of your winged
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.85,0:06:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon of Ra and swallow your\Ndark side for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.71,0:06:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.57,0:06:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.07,0:06:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi got rid of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.73,0:06:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So does that mean he won? Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.57,0:07:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek has one life point\Nleft, so the duel's not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.16,0:07:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,destroying the winged dragon of Ra should\Nhave destroyed Marek's dark side as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what about his\Ngood side? We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.87,0:07:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Marek?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.45,0:07:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But brother, please tell\Nme you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.45,0:07:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.29,0:07:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.05,0:07:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your evil side has been banished forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sure this is his good side, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.53,0:07:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, his face isn't as weird now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.39,0:07:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew Master Merrick's will was strong
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.77,0:07:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,enough to overcome the\Ndarkness in his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now his inner light can truly shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.61,0:07:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, there's still one more\Ntask that you and I must complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.23,0:07:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have one life point left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:07:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.35,0:08:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.49,0:08:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's dark side is back on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.81,0:08:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but now the tables have turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.15,0:08:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's good side is in control,\Nand the evil has become the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.21,0:08:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do this, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.13,0:08:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, we can still\Ncross the Barrow together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.73,0:08:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember how you wasted away\Nyour childhood serving this fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.99,0:08:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too late to destroy\Nhim and take what you deserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The infinite power of the\Npharaoh could be yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.51,0:08:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If we win this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,you and I can claim the three Egyptian\Ngod cards and the Millennium Puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.39,0:08:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll rule the world together!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.61,0:08:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool, Marek!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.51,0:08:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.21,0:08:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't throw away everything\Nwe've worked for!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We can still win. Your move. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.43,0:08:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,pharaoh it was my duty to help you and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,instead i turned my back i can't change\Nthe past but i can start over by embracing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.43,0:09:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,my family legacy i'm proud to be a\Ntomb keeper and i'm proud of my sister
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.53,0:09:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And my brother. Thank you, sir. My family\Nhas waited 5,000 years for your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.59,0:09:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So I must fulfill my destiny\Nby letting you fulfill yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.37,0:09:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I hold the key to helping\Nthe pharaoh unlock
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.19,0:09:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,his true powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The secret is imprinted on my\Nback in an ancient Egyptian text.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.77,0:09:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But before I reveal this mystery,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.67,0:09:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the pharaoh must be in possession\Nof all three Egyptian God cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making a huge mistake! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.17,0:09:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time in years,\NI'm making the right choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.31,0:09:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.63,0:09:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm honoring the Ishtar name\Nby surrendering the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.07,0:10:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.35,0:10:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,By forfeiting the duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.07,0:10:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,his life points will drop down to zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.89,0:10:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and his evil side will\Nvanish into the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.11,0:10:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do this, you'll be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.51,0:10:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You need
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.70,0:10:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Be My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.83,0:10:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I surrender this duel to the Pharaoh! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.71,0:10:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally over, my Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.57,0:10:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and the darkness has\Nlifted from your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.93,0:10:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We won the duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick has overpowered the evil\Nthat controlled him for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.63,0:10:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My Pharaoh, thank you.\NYou've saved mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.25,0:10:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We did I wouldn't have been victorious\Nhad it not been for all of you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.85,0:10:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And the winner of the Battle City\NChampionship crown is Yugi Moto! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Yugi! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm trying to do. Woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.13,0:11:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.43,0:11:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Yugi! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.49,0:11:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The way every monster\Nin your deck showed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.49,0:11:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That was classic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.25,0:11:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Up high, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.43,0:11:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That was truly a best work, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.25,0:11:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.79,0:11:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.37,0:11:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All that matters is that you're safe\Nand you've returned to the way you were,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.35,0:11:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You have fulfilled your destiny and\Nended the mission of the Tomb Keepers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,does this mean the three of us can start\Nover and build a new life for ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.21,0:11:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.15,0:11:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's time our family started\Nliving in the light, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.69,0:11:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Side by side with the rest of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.09,0:11:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.55,0:11:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.93,0:11:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but as the organizer of\Nthe Battle City Tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.73,0:11:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I should congratulate the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you only won that\Nduel due to Marek's forfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.73,0:12:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,if Kaiba hadn't given\Nme the card I needed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.63,0:12:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have lost the match right\Naway. Nice duel. And as the winner,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.45,0:12:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you get to keep the rarest\Ncard from your opponent's deck
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.71,0:12:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right. And the Pharaoh is going\Nto need that card soon. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.77,0:12:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure he doesn't give\Nyou the fake one Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.43,0:12:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,as I complete my final mission\NRest assured that everyone who
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.75,0:12:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,was banished to the Shadow Realm\Nby my dark side will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.43,0:12:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.55,0:12:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this, my rarest card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.61,0:12:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember, you're going\Nto need this card, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.27,0:12:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Winged Dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.63,0:12:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We have all three of\Nthe Egyptian God Cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.41,0:12:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that they're in our deck,\Nwhat are we supposed to do with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.59,0:13:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we use these cards to unlock\Nthe hidden powers of the pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.99,0:13:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We need more information.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.55,0:13:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have one more task to perform before\Nmy tomb keeper's mission is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.87,0:13:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.33,0:13:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The secret of the pharaoh's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting weird now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.31,0:13:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.29,0:13:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,These markings were\Npassed down by my family
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.19,0:13:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,from generation to\Ngeneration for 5,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We were taught that when the ancient\Npharaoh saved the world from destruction,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.13,0:13:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,he wiped his own memory clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But he knew that someday he would\Nreturn and he'd need his memory back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.45,0:13:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So he entrusted one family\Nwith his greatest secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.31,0:13:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,the key to unlocking\Nhis mind and his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you hold the three Egyptian\NGod Cards and the Millennium Puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.05,0:13:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,all you need to do is read\Nthe words on Marek's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.27,0:13:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.05,0:13:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.05,0:14:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you really read that chicken scratch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.43,0:14:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't understand those\Nancient symbols at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.45,0:14:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But I feel like the three Egyptian God\NCards are trying to show me what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.25,0:14:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the stone tablet from the museum!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.91,0:14:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Could the Pharaoh's secret\Nbe locked in this tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.77,0:14:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to leave now, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So please take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Rod belongs with you where\Nit won't cause any more harm. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.63,0:14:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And take this as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.67,0:14:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Ring is safest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.49,0:14:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you geeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.95,0:14:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This victory celebration\Nhas gone on long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.99,0:14:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The Battle City Tournament is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.21,0:14:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you'd like a free ride home, I'd\Nsuggest you board my aircraft right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.79,0:14:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.97,0:14:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone's left behind on the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.43,0:14:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the Kaiba Corporation will not\Nbe responsible for your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.25,0:14:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:15:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Because in one hour,\Nthis island will explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.07,0:15:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.57,0:15:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.63,0:15:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.77,0:15:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The dual tower will\Nself-destruct in one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.69,0:15:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So board the ship and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.11,0:15:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Mokuba said that the\Nengines weren't working on that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.45,0:15:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship has been repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, well, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you believe that, sore loser? I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba loses the tournament, so\Nhe decides to trash the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate the detonators, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Activating Kaiba Corp's dual\Ntower detonation system.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,One hour is plenty of time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.71,0:15:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship leaves now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.79,0:15:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.73,0:15:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then everyone should be\Na safe distance away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.51,0:15:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's do this, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.15,0:15:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Access code accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.13,0:16:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.65,0:16:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.95,0:16:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Identified.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.59,0:16:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Last but not least.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Key card A detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.35,0:16:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Key card B detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.55,0:16:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Detonation sequence has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.97,0:16:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.57,0:16:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, is my okay now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.45,0:16:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not up. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.69,0:16:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.15,0:16:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.53,0:16:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi beat Marek, so your mind should\Nhave been released from the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.91,0:16:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.81,0:16:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.49,0:16:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.91,0:16:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd give anything in the\Nworld to have your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.81,0:16:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.57,0:16:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.45,0:17:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.91,0:17:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That expression is priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.69,0:17:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I hear you say you'd give\Nanything to have me wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.55,0:17:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Because there's a few cards in that deck\Nof yours that I've had my eye on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.61,0:17:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice doing business with you, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.13,0:17:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.11,0:17:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He bought it hook, line, and sinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.05,0:17:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.25,0:17:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I just couldn't resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.35,0:17:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you guys were kidding all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.59,0:17:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That was not cool. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.11,0:17:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it was all in good fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.57,0:17:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.19,0:17:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can play jokes on people, too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.33,0:17:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that french fries I smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.69,0:17:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we take a lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.49,0:17:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.99,0:17:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys, but I'm\Nafraid the donuts are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.89,0:17:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bakura, you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.51,0:17:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you doing in\Nhere right in the refrigerator?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.23,0:18:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I was gone for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.67,0:18:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's not much to\Neat in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Go figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.83,0:18:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This aircraft is not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not without the Kaibas. Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.27,0:18:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We taking off or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.97,0:18:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't seem to locate Mokuba and Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.29,0:18:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.11,0:18:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole place is going to blow soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.01,0:18:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Kaiba said the dual tower would\Nself-destruct in less than an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.15,0:18:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's not that dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.05,0:18:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's hopping on board\Nhis private jet right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.63,0:18:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we can't take that chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.83,0:18:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.89,0:18:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We should go look for those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.59,0:18:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just way too nice. Let's go. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.81,0:18:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do me a favor and don't\Nleave till we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.91,0:18:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to get home in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare the engines now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.31,0:18:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.39,0:18:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Engaging main engines.\NVoltage check. Fuel check.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.99,0:19:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting rear thruster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.11,0:19:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. We have a problem. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I was afraid of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.01,0:19:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The engines are weak, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.15,0:19:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Worse, they're completely dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.41,0:19:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.63,0:19:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.69,0:19:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you guys said\Nthat they were fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean we're stuck here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.27,0:19:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.53,0:19:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dual tower will\Nself-destruct in 45 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.47,0:19:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate the island immediately.
